        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "53 FR 45445, PDF pages 11-11",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "fac949cc1cff29a1eddfe6db27dc1f58f760a5a39ca391155aa837c23e78fd20",
        "signing_date": "1988-11-07",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12655.txt",
        "text_sha256": "aba669e3cb352361e600bd6fa798e141073ed1e2d255d2372f85aeda96d8ad8e",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1988-11-10/pdf/FR-1988-11-10.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishm ent o f Board. There is established, a board of three  \nmembers to be appointed by the President to investigate this dispute. No  \nmember shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any organization of  \nrailroad employees or any carrier. The board shall perform its functions  \nsubject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2274,
      "char_start": 1924,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12655#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "scope_id": "EO:12655#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "53 FR 45445, PDF pages 11-11",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "fac949cc1cff29a1eddfe6db27dc1f58f760a5a39ca391155aa837c23e78fd20",
        "signing_date": "1988-11-07",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12655.txt",
        "text_sha256": "aba669e3cb352361e600bd6fa798e141073ed1e2d255d2372f85aeda96d8ad8e",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1988-11-10/pdf/FR-1988-11-10.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. Within 30 days after creation of the board, the parties to the  \ndispute shall submit to the board final offers for settlement of the dispute.  \nWithin 30 days after submission of final offers for settlement of the dispute,  \nthe board shall submit a report to the President setting forth its selection of the  \nmost reasonable offer."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2566,
      "char_start": 2275,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12655#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "scope_id": "EO:12655#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "53 FR 45445, PDF pages 11-11",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "fac949cc1cff29a1eddfe6db27dc1f58f760a5a39ca391155aa837c23e78fd20",
        "signing_date": "1988-11-07",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12655.txt",
        "text_sha256": "aba669e3cb352361e600bd6fa798e141073ed1e2d255d2372f85aeda96d8ad8e",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1988-11-10/pdf/FR-1988-11-10.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. M aintaining Conditions. As provided by Section 9A(h) of the Act, from  \nthe time a request to establish a board is made until 60 days after the board  \nmakes its report, no change, except by agreement, shall be made by the  \nparties in the conditions out of which the dispute arose."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2690,
      "char_start": 2567,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12655#sec4",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 4.",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "scope_id": "EO:12655#sec4",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "53 FR 45445, PDF pages 11-11",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "fac949cc1cff29a1eddfe6db27dc1f58f760a5a39ca391155aa837c23e78fd20",
        "signing_date": "1988-11-07",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12655.txt",
        "text_sha256": "aba669e3cb352361e600bd6fa798e141073ed1e2d255d2372f85aeda96d8ad8e",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1988-11-10/pdf/FR-1988-11-10.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. Expiration.  The board shall terminate upon the submission of the  \nreport provided for in Section 2 of this Order."
    }
  ],
